 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and February to March and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 190% of normal in April to May but just 36% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 20267 the lowest at 58%.</p>"}
